#: src/Abilities/CatalogueCheckAbility.php:81
msgid "Lists what keeps a part out of the builder: sources that disagree about a part, values that cannot be read, background work that failed and, for each kit, parts that lack a spec, presets that no longer fit and slots with nothing in stock. It reads every part and changes nothing."
